    "Thumbnails, album names, dates and file details are encrypted as well." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vorschaubilder, Albumnamen, Datum und Dateiangaben sind ebenfalls verschlüsselt."
